# 28. PRODUCT CONFIDENCE SCORE

Calculate:

```text
Product name found in product section       +25
Part/model number found                     +25
Technical specification found               +20
Product image associated                    +10
Product description found                   +10
Price/rate found                             +5
Product detail page                          +5
```

Result:

```text
90–100% = High confidence
75–89%  = Medium confidence
50–74%  = Review required
Below 50% = Reject / Do not create product
```

