# 58. FINAL ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA

The feature is complete only when:

- Vendor can be created using website/catalogue information.
- Vendor form is automatically populated.
- Missing information is clearly shown.
- User is asked only for genuinely missing/uncertain required data.
- Website is analysed intelligently.
