- Brands are automatically identified.
- Categories are automatically identified.
- Product families are automatically identified.
- Actual products are automatically identified.
- Part codes are preserved.
- Model numbers are preserved.
- Technical specifications are extracted.
- MRP/rates are linked to the correct product.
- Product names are source-supported.
- AI does not invent product names.
