- Vendor Product Mapping is maintained.
- Rate history is preserved by effective date/year.
- New rate catalogue can be uploaded once and automatically update current rates.
- Old rates remain available historically.
- Catalogue import can be archived/rolled back by batch.
- Historical RFQ/PO/quotation rates do not change when new catalogue rates arrive.
- All saved data persists in the production database.
- No fake success notification is shown when database save fails.
- No manual browser refresh is required.
- Existing ERP modules and data are preserved.
- Existing procurement workflow is not broken.

